<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The record on the splash screen. avd_vinyl_spin animates it in the system splash, and RolaboxSplash
  rotates it in Compose, so both draw the same shapes at the same size.
  The canvas is 288dp, which is what the system draws a splash icon at when it has no icon
  background (masked to a 192dp circle). The disc is drawn at the design's size, 133dp (60 units of
  a 129.6 unit viewport), centered.
-->
